{"id":"246d4beb5dedc741","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-hardy-addition-composition.md","title":"Hardy 层次的加法复合","display":"lem-hardy-addition-composition — Hardy 层次的加法复合","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-hardy-addition-composition","aliases":["72-lem-hardy-addition-composition"],"display":"lem-hardy-addition-composition — Hardy 层次的加法复合","chapter":"III","depends_on":["[[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]","[[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Lem.2.17; print158; PDF170","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_status":"checked","source_proof_status":"checked","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-hardy-addition-composition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-hardy-addition-composition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-hardy-addition-composition — Hardy 层次的加法复合"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fcd2431dc7fa995d\" href=\"?note=fcd2431dc7fa995d\" title=\"72-df-hardy-hierarchy\">72-df-hardy-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee59458b6acb7c90\" href=\"?note=ee59458b6acb7c90\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic\">72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Lem.2.17; print158; PDF170"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fcd2431dc7fa995d\" href=\"?note=fcd2431dc7fa995d\" title=\"72-df-hardy-hierarchy\">72-df-hardy-hierarchy</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee59458b6acb7c90\" href=\"?note=ee59458b6acb7c90\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic\">72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。函数复合按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(f\\circ g)(n)=f(g(n))\">\\((f\\circ g)(n)=f(g(n))\\)</span> 解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta}(n)=H_\\alpha(H_\\beta(n)),\\qquad H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta}=H_\\alpha\\circ H_\\beta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta}(n)=H_\\alpha(H_\\beta(n)),\\qquad H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta}=H_\\alpha\\circ H_\\beta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Lemma 2.17 及其证明，印刷 p.158 / PDF p.170。已核对加法次序与函数复合次序，不交换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>证明：对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 作树归纳。零分支为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\mathbf0}(n)=H_\\alpha(n)=H_\\alpha(H_\\mathbf0(n))\">\\(H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\mathbf0}(n)=H_\\alpha(n)=H_\\alpha(H_\\mathbf0(n))\\)</span>。后继分支为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\mathsf S\\beta}(n)=H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta}(n+1)=H_\\alpha(H_\\beta(n+1))=H_\\alpha(H_{\\mathsf S\\beta}(n))\">\\(H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\mathsf S\\beta}(n)=H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta}(n+1)=H_\\alpha(H_\\beta(n+1))=H_\\alpha(H_{\\mathsf S\\beta}(n))\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta=\\mathsf L((\\beta_i)_i)\">\\(\\beta=\\mathsf L((\\beta_i)_i)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta}(n)=H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta_n}(n)=H_\\alpha(H_{\\beta_n}(n))=H_\\alpha(H_\\beta(n))\">\\(H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta}(n)=H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta_n}(n)=H_\\alpha(H_{\\beta_n}(n))=H_\\alpha(H_\\beta(n))\\)</span>。逐点等式给出函数等式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-hardy-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"fcd2431dc7fa995d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"ee59458b6acb7c90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-hardy-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"fcd2431dc7fa995d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$H$ 见 [[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]；$\\oplus$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]。$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega$，$n\\in\\omega$。函数复合按 $(f\\circ g)(n)=f(g(n))$ 解释。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"ee59458b6acb7c90","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$H$ 见 [[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]；$\\oplus$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]。$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega$，$n\\in\\omega$。函数复合按 $(f\\circ g)(n)=f(g(n))$ 解释。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\oplus","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"(f\\circ g)(n)=f(g(n))","display":false},{"tex":"H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta}(n)=H_\\alpha(H_\\beta(n)),\\qquad H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta}=H_\\alpha\\circ H_\\beta.","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\mathbf0}(n)=H_\\alpha(n)=H_\\alpha(H_\\mathbf0(n))","display":false},{"tex":"H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\mathsf S\\beta}(n)=H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta}(n+1)=H_\\alpha(H_\\beta(n+1))=H_\\alpha(H_{\\mathsf S\\beta}(n))","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta=\\mathsf L((\\beta_i)_i)","display":false},{"tex":"H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta}(n)=H_{\\alpha\\oplus\\beta_n}(n)=H_\\alpha(H_{\\beta_n}(n))=H_\\alpha(H_\\beta(n))","display":false}],"bytes":1610,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-hardy-addition-composition|lem-hardy-addition-composition — Hardy 层次的加法复合]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-lem-hardy-addition-composition|lem-hardy-addition-composition — Hardy 层次的加法复合]]"},{"id":"4abdfa23c470566c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$B,F$ 与有限函数迭代 $f^{[k]}$ 见 [[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]；$H$、$\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow},\\overline k,\\boldsymbol\\omega$ 及加法复合恒等式见 [[72-lem-hardy-addition-composition]]。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-258","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-lem-hardy-addition-composition|72-lem-hardy-addition-composition]]"}],"outgoing":["fcd2431dc7fa995d","ee59458b6acb7c90"]}